# HAGU buttons

Use shared classes from `globals.css`. Do not invent per-screen button styles.

| Role | Class / component |
|------|-------------------|
| Primary CTA | `hagu-btn-primary` or `ScreenPrimaryButton` |
| Secondary | `hagu-btn-secondary` or `ScreenSecondaryButton` |
| Destructive (cancel) | `hagu-btn-destructive` or `ScreenDestructiveButton` |
| Split card actions | `hagu-action-btn-muted` + `hagu-action-btn-dark` |
| OAuth | `hagu-auth-btn` via `AuthProviderButton` |

## Spec (all full-width CTAs)

- Height: **h-12** (48px)
- Radius: **rounded-[20px]**
- Text: **text-sm font-medium**
- Primary: `bg-hagu-heading text-white`
- Secondary: white + `border-hagu-border`
- Destructive: white + `border-hagu-border` + `text-hagu-error`

## Avoid

- `rounded-full` / `rounded-[32px]` on action buttons
- `h-14` / `h-16` one-off overrides on `ScreenPrimaryButton`
- Teal bordered decline buttons — use secondary style
